      "question": "How does the annual discount work?",
      "answer": "When you choose annual billing, you pay for 10 months and get 2 months free — that's a 20% saving compared to monthly billing."
    },
    {
      "question": "What payment methods do you accept for subscriptions?",
      "answer": "We accept M-Pesa and card payments for your SalesZote subscription."
    },
    {
      "question": "What happens after my free trial ends?",
      "answer": "You will be prompted to select a plan and add a payment method. Your data is safe and nothing is deleted."
    },
    {
